            "text": "This would be the last of the relics. Please find the materials to help Mr. Kayvan do his job."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7310401",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Helbet and Kayvan",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "731040101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "731040101": {
            "id": "731040101",
            "speakerId": 12710,
            "speakerName": "Helbet",
            "text": "Please, do me a favor! I could really use your help!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040102"
            ]
          },
          "731040102": {
            "id": "731040102",
            "speakerId": 4163,
            "speakerName": "Kayvan",
            "text": "No can do. Please go.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040103"
            ]
          },
          "731040103": {
            "id": "731040103",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa, what's with the quarrel?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040104"
            ]
          },
          "731040104": {
            "id": "731040104",
            "speakerId": 4163,
            "speakerName": "Kayvan",
            "text": "Hey, outlander, care to help me persuade this lady here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040105"
            ]
          },
          "731040105": {
            "id": "731040105",
            "speakerId": 4163,
            "speakerName": "Kayvan",
            "text": "She came to ask me to salvage some antiques. Has been bugging me all day.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040106"
            ]
          },
          "731040106": {
            "id": "731040106",
            "speakerId": 4163,
            "speakerName": "Kayvan",
            "text": "She not only scared away my fish but also wants to keep taking up my time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040107"
            ]
          },
          "731040107": {
            "id": "731040107",
            "speakerId": 4163,
            "speakerName": "Kayvan",
            "text": "Miss, why such a hurry? Trying to rake it in with the antiques?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040108"
            ]
          },
          "731040108": {
            "id": "731040108",
            "speakerId": 12710,
            "speakerName": "Helbet",
            "text": "No, Mr. Kayvan. I am Helbet with the Akademiya.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040109"
            ]
          },
          "731040109": {
            "id": "731040109",
            "speakerId": 12710,
            "speakerName": "Helbet",
            "text": "The Akademiya found those antiques and I'm responsible for keeping them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040110"
            ]
          },
          "731040110": {
            "id": "731040110",
            "speakerId": 12710,
            "speakerName": "Helbet",
            "text": "But there was an accident on the ship transporting the relics. Some dropped off the ship, floating down the river to the lower reaches.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040111"
            ]
          },
          "731040111": {
            "id": "731040111",
            "speakerId": 4163,
            "speakerName": "Kayvan",
            "text": "Then go to a professional salvage team! Why bother a fisherman like me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040112"
            ]
          },
          "731040112": {
            "id": "731040112",
            "speakerId": 12710,
            "speakerName": "Helbet",
            "text": "It takes too long to find a suitable salvage team. I've heard people call you \"Supreme Hookshot\" and that you fish lost items up from the river nearly every day.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040113"
            ]
          },
          "731040113": {
            "id": "731040113",
            "speakerId": 12710,
            "speakerName": "Helbet",
            "text": "And you've been fishing around a lot, so I thought I'd ask you to try casting your rod, see if you could get the relics...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040117",
              "731040116"
            ]
          },
          "731040117": {
            "id": "731040117",
            "speakerId": 4163,
            "speakerName": "Kayvan",
            "text": "Ahem, Miss Helbet, I feel sorry for what you have been through. But I'm only a fisherman.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040118"
            ]
          },
          "731040118": {
            "id": "731040118",
            "speakerId": 4163,
            "speakerName": "Kayvan",
            "text": "I cast my rod to catch fish and fish only.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040119"
            ]
          },
          "731040119": {
            "id": "731040119",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You haven't caught even one fish...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040120"
            ]
          },
          "731040120": {
            "id": "731040120",
            "speakerId": 4163,
            "speakerName": "Kayvan",
            "text": "Ahem! I've been training to do that with the pure thought in mind. Never thought about hooking other stuff.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040121"
            ]
          },
          "731040121": {
            "id": "731040121",
            "speakerId": 4163,
            "speakerName": "Kayvan",
            "text": "So you'd better find someone else.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040122"
            ]
          },
          "731040122": {
            "id": "731040122",
            "speakerId": 12710,
            "speakerName": "Helbet",
            "text": "Eh... Eh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040123"
            ]
          },
          "731040123": {
            "id": "731040123",
            "speakerId": 12710,
            "speakerName": "Helbet",
            "text": "Then... How about this, I won't ask you to hook the relics for me, I just need you to go fishing at another place. What do you say?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040124"
            ]
          },
          "731040124": {
            "id": "731040124",
            "speakerId": 12710,
            "speakerName": "Helbet",
            "text": "I'm paying you to catch fish! Please, I'm counting on you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "731040125"
            ]
          },
          "731040125": {
            "id": "731040125",
            "speakerId": 4163,
            "speakerName": "Kayvan",
            "text": "Ugh... I am a fisherman! A fisherman!"
          },
          "731040116": {
            "id": "731040116",
            "speakerId": 4163,
            "speakerName": "Kayvan",
            "text": "I cast my rod only to get fish, okay!?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
